{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0033_1000_040tam", "source_sha256": "f61e709e21ebcc3d6436425818dad7147ed6a9b7f64320a6b857bed6e96835d6", "ja": "そーっと、そーっと……よし、\n廊下には誰もいないぞ、このまま……。", "zh": "轻轻地、轻轻地……\n很好，走廊上没人，就照这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0033_1001_p", "source_sha256": "702f51c6a6835428afe628971f9e5d2bdb6fece93e768894fafda603c2160f21", "ja": "あっ！？　こら環、具合悪いんだから、\nちゃんと寝てなきゃダメじゃないか！", "zh": "啊！？喂，环！你身体不舒服，\n得好好躺着才行啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0033_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "d90341fba4418b3fc944ed4d001234f70167a5d3aa431bbaafbf33b8f826f2c8", "ja": "うわ～っ、見つかった！　さすがおやぶん……。\nでもたまき、もう元気だよ？　遊びに行きたい！", "zh": "哇～被发现了！不愧是老大……\n不过环已经好了喔？所以想出去玩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0033_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "a7b69f553850d6e949dc6d80f44c7e38c77062a21f46530b9683125d36295e2a", "ja": "さっきは、スーパーたまきまわしの練習で疲れて、\nちょびっとお風呂でのぼせてただけだもん！", "zh": "刚才只是因为练习超级跳环练得太累，\n才在泡澡时有点泡昏头而已啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0033_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3367692755a45d3aea40b57d99c11e30cc5c837807310be70172a92cb58462b2", "ja": "ダメだって。真っ赤な顔でフラフラしてたくせに、\nなに言ってるんだ。もう少し横になってないと……。", "zh": "就说不行了。你的脸这么红又摇摇晃晃的，\n还在说什么傻话，要再多躺一下才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0033_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "beeabd8737be369b17f70346fe38232c6df4e34e72bce7000017221054abc354", "ja": "えぇ～、寝てるだけなんて、つまんないよ～。\nたまき、みんなのところに行きたいよ～。", "zh": "咦～只能一直躺着很无聊欸～\n环想去找大家啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0033_1006_p", "source_sha256": "14ab2296808b477ece70f24fe976304c6afcb2dee9373b322a52b97367d8e208", "ja": "うーん……今日はもう、このまま\n寝た方がいいと思うけどな。", "zh": "嗯……我觉得你今天\n就这样早点睡会比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0033_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "d0b22de05a2b4fcb3d416ffcc92ed00f8a646e3b1707e77eca592484229317e0", "ja": "うう……たまき、ひとりはさびしいぞ……。\nおやぶんも、お仕事に行っちゃうんでしょ～？", "zh": "呜呜……环一个人很寂寞耶……\n老大也要去工作对不对～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0033_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c3ab9a25824a6acb3a949deb92675a58bfebaae171940fafd7e5e20e46f4b274", "ja": "いや、環が寝るまで一緒にいるよ。", "zh": "不，我会等到环睡着为止。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0033_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "2bb59f3a1b8c67e5d303acc2fc85684763c0bbb71f5f65eb52b84a0df6824481", "ja": "えっ、ほんと！？　やったあ！\nじゃあたまき、寝ないように頑張ろうっと！", "zh": "咦，真的吗！？好耶！\n那环就努力不要睡着！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0033_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "0864a1aec4e5d81a28ea204ea81b073333a870b67ccea5e74d87ebb9532f029e", "ja": "おやぶんとたっくさんお話するんだ！　くふふ♪\nえっとね、えっと……ふぁ……。", "zh": "环要跟老大说很多话！呵呵♪\n还有啊，那个……呼哇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0033_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "7135ca49c3ecbb752fe5b0fe63a06366c02abd042ff10e5a3d5718a57837bdfa", "ja": "ね、眠くないぞ！　たまき、全然眠くない……\nふわぁ……むにゅう……。", "zh": "才、才不困喔！环一点也不困……\n呼哇……嗯唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
